  "fire": {
    "beam": "primary fire (hold): play fire_start once (8 frames: the trigger pulls, the prongs open 10 deg), then loop fire (30 frames: the prongs flicker +-1.2 deg and the barrel pulses 1 cm back and home once a second, 15 frames back, 15 home), and on release play fire_end (10 frames). Draw the beam from Muzzle (forward = the beam's direction) from fire_start's frame 3 and through fire; arc the ArcTip gizmos to it; heat shimmer at the Vent gizmos.",
    "orb": "secondary fire: play fire_orb (33 frames, from idle): the prongs snap open 18 deg by frame 3, when the orb leaves: spawn it at Muzzle's transform; the barrel recoils 1 cm and is home by the last frame.",
    "idle": "loop idle between shots: the prongs breathe 3 deg open and closed over 60 frames. Every prong action starts and ends closed (fire at the beam's opening), so they chain without a jump.",
    "recoil_m": 0.01,
    "recoil_frames": [
      15,
      15
    ],
    "orb_frame": 3
  },
