    "axis": [
      0.0,
      0.9925,
      0.1219
    ],
    "pitch_deg": 7,
    "rails_m": 0.015,
    "note": "mag_release lifts the latch and runs the pack back and up its axis until its cells' nubs leave their sockets; past MAG_TRAVEL it is free: hide the pack mesh and drop a physics copy of the pickup mesh at the Mag bone's transform (pitched). To reload, put the pack back at the end of its travel and play mag_insert."
  },
